<title>USA: Peerless Group Q1 shr jumps to $0.10.</title>
<headline>Peerless Group Q1 shr jumps to $0.10.</headline>
<dateline>RICHARDSON, Texas 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>						Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						     March 31,</p>
<p>					   1997		    1996</p>
<p> Total revenues		     7,551		   5,459</p>
<p> Income before income taxes	 794		     236</p>
<p> Income tax expense		   300			35</p>
<p> Net income			     494		     201</p>
<p>Net income per common and</p>
<p>  common equivalent share	  0.10		    0.05</p>
<p>Pro forma net income per</p>
<p>  common share (fully taxed)(a)  0.10		    0.04</p>
<p>Shares used in computing</p>
<p>  per share net income	    5,144		   3,716</p>
<p>(a) Calculated as income before income taxes, less proforma income taxes, using the first quarter of 1997 tax rate of approximately 38 percent, divided by shares used in computing per share net income.</p>
<p>NOTE: Per share figures reflect new shares issued in the company's initial public offering in October.</p>
<p>--((New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
